eng-fra-excerpt.txt is 318 lines of eng-fra.txt from the PyTorch seq2seq
tutorial's data archive, https://download.pytorch.org/tutorial/data.zip,
copied verbatim: every 40th sentence pair that survives the tutorial's
filter, followed by 31 pairs it rejects. That file is the English-French
tab-delimited export of the Tatoeba Project, https://tatoeba.org, as
distributed by https://www.manythings.org/anki/, and is licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France (CC BY 2.0 FR):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/

heart-of-darkness-excerpt.txt is from Joseph Conrad's Heart of Darkness
(Project Gutenberg #219), in the public domain. The mnist-256-* files are
the first 256 records of the MNIST training set.
